# This package holds application-level utility classes that are genuinely
# universal and carry no domain semantics.
#
# Examples of permitted contents:
#   - String normalization utilities
#   - Date/time formatting helpers
#   - JSON serialization utilities
#
# Domain utilities belong in their owning module's api/ package.
# See docs/architecture/REPOSITORY_STRUCTURE.md §11.4 for the
# Shared Utilities Anti-Pattern that this constraint guards against.
